          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.229,
            0.852,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": "**Q. How should the rectangle be constructed so that the diagonal divides the opposite angles into equal parts?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.274,
            0.848,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** The rectangle should be constructed in such a manner that the two adjacent sides are equal i.e. the rectangle becomes a square."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
